  <!-- ======================================================
       MAIN CONTENT
  ======================================================= -->

  <main class="impact-page">

    <!-- ====================================================
         HERO POSTER
    ===================================================== -->

    <section class="impact-hero" aria-label="Sandman Combat Impact">

      <div data-lang-block="en">
        <img
          src="/assets/img/pages/impact/hero-impact-en.png"
          alt="Changing lives and building legacies through Sandman Combat."
          class="impact-hero__image"
        />
      </div>

      <div data-lang-block="es" class="hidden-lang">
        <img
          src="/assets/img/pages/impact/hero-impact-es.png"
          alt="Cambiando vidas y construyendo legados a través de Sandman Combat."
          class="impact-hero__image"
        />
      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ====================================================
         BUILDING BETTER PEOPLE
    ===================================================== -->

    <section class="impact-section impact-section--intro">
      <div class="impact-container">

        <div data-lang-block="en">

          <p class="impact-eyebrow">Beyond Competition</p>

          <h1>Building Better People</h1>

          <p class="impact-lead">
            Winning is exciting. Growth is lasting.
          </p>

          <p>
            Every practice is an opportunity to become stronger—not only
            physically, but mentally, emotionally, and socially.
          </p>

          <p>
            The lessons learned through combat sports continue long after
            the match ends.
          </p>

          <div class="impact-statement">
            <p>The greatest victories are not always measured by medals.</p>

            <strong>
              They are measured by the person an athlete becomes.
            </strong>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div data-lang-block="es" class="hidden-lang">

          <p class="impact-eyebrow">Más Allá de la Competencia</p>

          <h1>Formando Mejores Personas</h1>

          <p class="impact-lead">
            Ganar emociona. El crecimiento permanece.
          </p>

          <p>
            Cada práctica es una oportunidad para fortalecerse—no solamente
            físicamente, sino también mental, emocional y socialmente.
          </p>

          <p>
            Las lecciones aprendidas a través de los deportes de combate
            continúan mucho después de terminar la competencia.
          </p>

          <div class="impact-statement">
            <p>
              Las victorias más grandes no siempre se miden con medallas.
            </p>

            <strong>
              Se miden por la persona en la que se convierte el atleta.
            </strong>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ====================================================
         MORE THAN CHAMPIONSHIPS
    ===================================================== -->

    <section class="impact-section impact-section--championships">
      <div class="impact-container">

        <div data-lang-block="en">

          <p class="impact-eyebrow">The Greater Mission</p>

          <h2>More Than Championships</h2>

          <p class="impact-lead">
            Championships matter, but they are never the final goal.
          </p>

          <p>
            The greatest accomplishment is helping young people become
            confident adults who positively influence their families,
            workplaces, schools, and communities.
          </p>

          <blockquote class="impact-quote">
            <p>
              We do not measure success only by what athletes win.
            </p>

            <strong>
              We measure success by who they become.
            </strong>
          </blockquote>

        </div>

        <div data-lang-block="es" class="hidden-lang">

          <p class="impact-eyebrow">La Misión Más Grande</p>

          <h2>Más que Campeonatos</h2>

          <p class="impact-lead">
            Los campeonatos importan, pero nunca son la meta final.
          </p>

          <p>
            El logro más grande es ayudar a los jóvenes a convertirse en
            adultos seguros que influyan positivamente en sus familias,
            trabajos, escuelas y comunidades.
          </p>

          <blockquote class="impact-quote">
            <p>
              No medimos el éxito solamente por lo que ganan los atletas.
            </p>

            <strong>
              Medimos el éxito por la persona en la que se convierten.
            </strong>
          </blockquote>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ====================================================
         A LEGACY THAT MULTIPLIES
    ===================================================== -->

    <section class="impact-section impact-section--legacy">
      <div class="impact-container">

        <div data-lang-block="en">

          <p class="impact-eyebrow">Heroes Build Heroes</p>

          <h2>A Legacy That Multiplies</h2>

          <div class="impact-rhythm">
            <strong>
              Every athlete becomes an example for someone else.
            </strong>

            <strong>
              Every family strengthens the community.
            </strong>

            <strong>
              Every coach helps create future leaders.
            </strong>
          </div>

          <p>
            Impact is not measured by how many people know the Sandman name.
          </p>

          <div class="impact-statement impact-statement--centered">
            <strong>
              It is measured by how many lives are better because Sandman
              existed.
            </strong>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div data-lang-block="es" class="hidden-lang">

          <p class="impact-eyebrow">Los Héroes Construyen Héroes</p>

          <h2>Un Legado que se Multiplica</h2>

          <div class="impact-rhythm">
            <strong>
              Cada atleta se convierte en un ejemplo para alguien más.
            </strong>

            <strong>
              Cada familia fortalece la comunidad.
            </strong>

            <strong>
              Cada entrenador ayuda a formar futuros líderes.
            </strong>
          </div>

          <p>
            El impacto no se mide por cuántas personas conocen el nombre
            Sandman.
          </p>

          <div class="impact-statement impact-statement--centered">
            <strong>
              Se mide por cuántas vidas son mejores porque Sandman existió.
            </strong>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ====================================================
         CTA
    ===================================================== -->

    <section class="impact-cta">
      <div class="impact-container">

        <div data-lang-block="en">

          <p class="impact-eyebrow">Your Story</p>

          <h2>Begin Your Journey</h2>

          <p>
            Whether your goal is confidence, competition, fitness, or
            personal growth, your story begins with one decision.
          </p>

          <p class="impact-cta__statement">
            The next Sandman success story could be yours.
          </p>

          <a href="/journeys.html" class="button button--primary">
            Explore the Journeys
          </a>

        </div>

        <div data-lang-block="es" class="hidden-lang">

          <p class="impact-eyebrow">Tu Historia</p>

          <h2>Comienza Tu Trayectoria</h2>

          <p>
            Ya sea que tu meta sea confianza, competencia, condición física
            o crecimiento personal, tu historia comienza con una decisión.
          </p>

          <p class="impact-cta__statement">
            La próxima historia de éxito Sandman podría ser la tuya.
          </p>

          <a href="/journeys.html" class="button button--primary">
            Explorar las Trayectorias
          </a>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ====================================================
         CLOSING
    ===================================================== -->

    <section class="impact-closing">
      <div class="impact-container">

        <div data-lang-block="en">
          <p>Changing lives. Building legacies.</p>
          <h2>Combat = Character</h2>
        </div>

        <div data-lang-block="es" class="hidden-lang">
          <p>Cambiando vidas. Construyendo legados.</p>
          <h2>Combate = Carácter</h2>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

